            },
            {
              "function": "minecraft:set_written_book_pages",
              "pages": [
                [
                  "",
                  {
                    "text": "Litany of the Chimes",
                    "bold": true,
                    "color": "dark_aqua"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "\n\nSaid at the Choir Hall, at the rites of the conductors.",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  }
                ],
                "Six chimes stand in a ring about the altar, and the conductor lays a frozen echo upon it. Then the altar sings, and the chimes light one by one.",
                "Answer the altar note for note, each chime in the order it was sung, before the echo fades. A wrong note, and the song must begin again.",
                [
                  "",
                  {
                    "text": "Conductor:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " What is sung?\n",
                  {
                    "text": "Choir:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " Is never lost.\n",
                  {
                    "text": "Conductor:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " Who holds the note?\n",
                  {
                    "text": "Choir:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " Every voice a lantern.\n",
                  {
                    "text": "Conductor:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " Listen first.\n",
                  {
                    "text": "Choir:",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  " We are listening."
                ],
                [
                  "",
                  {
                    "text": "(Added in another hand, after the Rest:)",
                    "italic": true,
                    "color": "dark_gray"
                  },
                  "\n\nDo not sing the litany at the Hall. The conductor is gone, but the altar is still answered. Something rises to finish the song."
                ]
              ],
              "mode": "replace_all"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "minecraft:item",
